  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 1 (right): radar chart of micro-F1 scores (radial axis 0 to 1) on 16 tasks prefixed B- (burden), RF- (risk factors) and I- (interventions), for seven models: Command-R-0824-32B, Flan-T5-xxl, Gemma-2-27B-It, Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct, Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2, Mistral-Large-AWQ4Bit, Stable-Beluga-2. Most models score near 0.8-0.95 on B-News Headline and B-GI Classification and lower on I-Causal Relations and I-BioDex Drugs Extraction.",
